# Lab module docs

Each lab folder should stay consistent:

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `README.md` | Cover: time, skills, link to LESSON/LAB, catch-up script |
| `LESSON.md` | Concepts only |
| `LAB.md` | Hands-on steps, paths, acceptance, troubleshooting |

## Conventions

- Point catch-up to `scripts/*.robin` when present; note `full` vs `partial-ui`
- Use official PAD action names from `shared/OFFICIAL-TERMINOLOGY.md`
- Lab Hub selectors: prefer `#id` / `[data-pad=…]` (`shared/SELECTOR-CONVENTIONS.md`)
- Contoso: link `assets/ui-map.md` + setup zip from Microsoft Learn samples
- Keep Thai learner voice; code blocks / paths copy-paste ready

## Do not

- Expand scope into unrelated modules in the same change
- Document cloud-flow-only patterns as desktop steps
